WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Get ready and low. Bend your knees. Show an open glove out front.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Meet the gentle roll. Watch the ball into your glove on a level surface.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Secure, then reset. Bring the ball in. Set your feet before a return throw.

